// The Network capability: the effect a program's row names when it asks for
// the network. Like Filesystem (lib/fs.mn) it is a module of its own, so any
// program can promise with !Network that a function never asks for the
// network, through every function it calls.
//
// The library ships no handler for it yet, and no program can write one that
// reaches a network: the WebAssembly the compiler emits targets WASI preview
// 1, which offers no outbound connection, so the emitted code imports no
// socket. A real handler needs the compiler to emit a WASI 0.2 component,
// whose sockets and HTTP interfaces a host can grant.
effect Network {
  // the text at a web address
  fetch(url: String) -> String
}
